  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 9.0.0\n* Update readme to clarify C# language version requirement\n* Updated from Polyfill 9.0.1 to 9.0.3 \n* Renamed TimeSpan returning ``Difference`` extension methods to ``TimeSpanDifference``\n* Added DateSpan returning ``DateSpanDifference`` extension methods\n* Moved ``WindowsFilePermission`` static extension members from DotPrimitives\n* Added FileInfo static extension method members ``HasExecutePermissions``, ``HasReadPermissionms``, and ``HasWritePermissions`` - These support both Unix and Windows based operating systems.\n* Moved Unix Numeric Permission notation parsing and Unix Rwx Symbolic notation parsing via static extension method members on ``UnixFileMode``.",
